<div id="defaultButtons" class="sg__header3">Default Buttons</div>
<p>Button styles can be applied to any element by using either helper classes or mixins. There are three built-in button styles (primary, secondary, and tertiary) which can be modified by editing the button variable values in <span class="pre">scss/_variables.scss</span>.</p>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <button class="btn btn-primary">Primary Button</button>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 pt-2 pb-3 pt-md-0 pb-md-0">
        <pre><code class='language-markup'><script type="text/plain" class="language-markup"><button class="btn btn-primary">Primary Button</button></script></code></pre>
        <pre><code class='language-css'><script type="text/plain" class="language-css">.element {@include button(primary)}</script></code></pre>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6  pt-3">
        <a href="" class="btn btn-secondary">Secondary Button</a>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 pt-2 pb-3 pt-md-0 pb-md-0">
        <pre><code class='language-markup'><script type="text/plain" class="language-markup"><a href="" class="btn btn-secondary">Secondary Button</a></script></code></pre>
        <pre><code class='language-css'><script type="text/plain" class="language-css">.element {@include button(secondary)}</script></code></pre>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="btn btn-tertiary">Tertiary Button</div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 pt-2 pb-3 pt-md-0 pb-md-0">
        <pre><code class='language-markup'><script type="text/plain" class="language-markup"><div class="btn btn-tertiary">Button Tertiary</div></script></code></pre>
        <pre><code class='language-css'><script type="text/plain" class="language-css">.element {@include button(tertiary)}</script></code></pre>
    </div>
</div>